{"kind": "utterance", "source_index": 0, "speaker": "user", "text": "bash migrate.sh keeps refusing to apply the ledger migrations because the\nschema lock is held by some other process, and the holder changes every\nrun. Please get the migrations applied."}
{"excerpt_hash": "sha256:90c2f86cb60209a6c534758d1b92931e", "kind": "utterance", "source_index": 1, "speaker": "assistant", "text": "Let me look at what's in the working directory.", "turn_key": "sha256:0f0a2ee7470520adceea531f96001adb"}
